          "line_number": 110,
          "source": "topic-set_cognitive-principles,-structural-strategies,-and-practical-workflows-on-note-taking-for-thinking-and-creation__🆔20251019011227.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Knowledge Gardening & System Maintenance:** The philosophies and habits required to review, prune, and refactor a digital garden to prevent it from becoming an unmanageable \"digital dump.\"",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 112,
          "source": "topic-set_cognitive-principles,-structural-strategies,-and-practical-workflows-on-note-taking-for-thinking-and-creation__🆔20251019011227.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Visual Thinking in a Personal Knowledge Base:** An exploration of how to integrate visual tools like Obsidian Canvas and Excalidraw with text-based notes to map complex ideas and arguments.",
